Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:03:11 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Expose explicit lint source roots, owned semantic facts and
 ty precision metadata

Aggregate fork patch on exact Ruff 0.16.10 parent. Existing native traversal and sticky precision metadata are unchanged; make the existing deterministic LinterSettings::new_with_src constructor public for check_path consumers without ambient cwd reads.
